cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Cleanet Doublet Removal
abstract: Finds and removes doublets (two cells measured as one event) in each FCS file with Cleanet,
  which simulates doublets from random pairs of events and flags events whose marker-space neighbours
  are mostly simulated doublets. Writes the singlets, a per-sample table and a diagnostic plot per sample.
